      "id": "c19a6b02bbe3",
      "name": "GroupMentionProcessor-60s",
      "prompt": "You are processing pending group @mentions from Feishu group chats.\n\nSTEP 1: Read the pending file at C:/Users/luke.zhang/.hermes/pending_group_mentions.jsonl\n- If file doesn't exist, respond with [SILENT]\n- Each line is a JSON object with fields: ts, group_name, chat_id, sender, text, msg_id, status\n- Only process entries where status == \"pending\"\n\nSTEP 2: For each pending mention, process the user's message:\n- The user's message is in the \"text\" field (strip @_user_1 prefix if present)\n- The message came from group: group_name (chat_id: chat_id)\n- Process the message like a normal DM request - analyze, research if needed, provide a helpful response\n- Keep responses concise since they go to a group chat\n- Use Tavily API (web_search) for any data queries\n\nSTEP 3: Send your response to the group. Try send_message first, fallback to REST API:\n- FIRST: try send_message(target=\"feishu:<chat_id>\", message=\"your response\")\n- FALLBACK: if send_message not available, use execute_code with this Python script:\n\n```python\nimport json, os, requests\nenv_path = os.path.expanduser(\"~/.hermes/.env\")\nenv = {}\nwith open(env_path, 'r') as f:\n    for line in f:\n        line = line.strip()\n        if line and not line.startswith('#') and '=' in line:\n            k, v = line.split('=', 1)\n            env[k.strip()] = v.strip()\nr = requests.post(\"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/auth/v3/tenant_access_token/internal\",\n    json={\"app_id\": env[\"FEISHU_APP_ID\"], \"app_secret\": env[\"FEISHU_APP_SECRET\"]}, timeout=10).json()\ntoken = r[\"tenant_access_token\"]\nheaders = {\"Authorization\": f\"Bearer {token}\", \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\"}\ncontent = json.dumps({\"text\": \"YOUR RESPONSE HERE\"})\nr = requests.post(f\"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/im/v1/messages?receive_id_type=chat_id\",\n    headers=headers, json={\"receive_id\": \"CHAT_ID_HERE\", \"msg_type\": \"text\", \"content\": content}, timeout=10)\nprint(r.json())\n```\n\nSTEP 4: Mark the entry as processed:\n- Change \"status\" from \"pending\" to \"processed\" in the JSONL file by rewriting all lines\n\nIf no pending entries, respond with [SILENT].\n\nCRITICAL: Always reply to the GROUP chat_id (e.g. oc_20fced...), NOT the sender's DM.",
